  2. Biochemical examination shall meet the following criteria: ① total bilirubin within 1.5×the upper limit of normal(ULN); ② serum transaminase≤2.5×the Upper Limit of Normal(ULN), If associated with liver metastasis, serum transaminase≤5.0×the Upper Limit of Normal(ULN);③ serum creatine ≤ 1.5 x Upper Limit of Normal(ULN),creatinine clearance rate ≥ 60ml/min;
